bullet("- **Run ids of everything that feeds a verdict**", """- **Run ids of everything that feeds a verdict** (hard rule 3: all through `run.py`). *Base side, registered in the card's `base` arm (four ids):* `t26.base_eval` (the base on GT v13, VAL 1000, WITHOUT the velocity rows; done), `t26.base_eval_vel` (the same with `--curves --fusion --velocity`: the control of the JSON clauses; it writes the same store file `by_n/card_n1000.json` and replaces the first one, which is kept as `temp/t26/base_eval_noVel_copy/`), `t26.base_eval43` (all val frames of the 43 common scenes; done), `t26.ref_maps_base` (the maps scorer; done, `records/t26_g0/`). All four score the LIVE training code from the variant folder `temp/t26/base_run/` (a copy of the base's `config.json`, `gt.json` and checkpoint 6000): the old run's own `code/` imports the removed `autogt` package (D78 / D81); method of `records/t25_p4_readout_2026-11-14.txt`, no alias. *t26 side, to launch (appended to the arms when launched):* `t26.one_s0`; `t26.one_s0.eval` (VAL 1000, **with `--curves --fusion --velocity`, as `t26.base_eval_vel`**: the JSON clauses read those rows); `t26.one_s0.eval43` (`bev_suite.py <run> eval --scenes $(cat records/t26_g0/scenes43.txt)`, cold); `t26.ref_maps_one` (`soa_maps.py <run folder> <out.json> --frames-from records/t26_g0/ref_maps_base_out.json`; no `--allow-gt-mismatch`: the run's own GT is v13); `t26.ref_crn_smoke` (CRN, 50 samples with TF32 off and on, gate b) and `t26.ref_crn` (the full export: `evaluation/crn/RUN.md` steps 0 - 7; gates a, b, c decide "maps only"). The object row is then `bev_suite.py front crn=<crn_front.pkl> <t26 run> <base> --x-max 50 --n all` with the REFERENCE FIRST (the sign of d is system minus reference) and the stores of the 43 scenes (`--n all`). The 246-frame read-outs of kept checkpoints are diagnostics (`--no-card`, never a verdict).""")

